{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "pinv-header",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 20,
      "width": 3480,
      "height": 180,
      "text": "# 广义逆与最小范数解\n\n先分清左逆、右逆及其秩条件，再区分一般广义逆与唯一的 Moore–Penrose 伪逆。SVD 一方面给出精确公式与存在唯一性，另一方面暴露小奇异值造成的数值不稳定。\n\n**箭头只表示可辩护的定义、推出、特化或算法选择关系；颜色区分语义角色。**"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-group-one-sided",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 240,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 830,
      "label": "单侧逆：定义 → 秩等价 → 满秩闭式"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-left-def-0010",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[左逆|Left inverse]]\n\nFor $A\\in\\mathbb F^{m\\times n}$, $LA=I_n$ recovers every input from its image. The matrix $A$ need not reach every output.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n$LA=I_n$保证从输出恢复原输入，不保证覆盖全部输出。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-left-rank-0001",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## [[左逆与满列秩]]\nLA-PINV-001 · 等价命题\n\n左逆存在当且仅当 $A$ 满列秩，也就是零空间只有零向量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-fullcol-formula-0014",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[满列秩伪逆公式|Full-column-rank pseudoinverse]]\n\n$A^+=(A^*A)^{-1}A^*$ gives the unique least-squares coefficients and satisfies $A^+A=I_n$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n满列秩使 $A^*A$ 可逆；规范左逆给出唯一最小二乘系数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-right-def-0011",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[右逆|Right inverse]]\n\nFor $A\\in\\mathbb F^{m\\times n}$, $AR=I_m$ supplies an input for every output. The input need not be unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n$AR=I_m$为每个输出提供一个输入，输入未必唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-right-rank-0002",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "## [[右逆与满行秩]]\nLA-PINV-002 · 等价命题\n\n右逆存在当且仅当 $A$ 满行秩，也就是列空间覆盖整个输出空间。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-fullrow-formula-0015",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1420,
      "y": 640,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[满行秩伪逆公式|Full-row-rank pseudoinverse]]\n\n$A^+=A^*(AA^*)^{-1}$ selects the shortest exact input for every target; $AA^+=I_m$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n满行秩使 $AA^*$ 可逆；规范右逆为每个目标选最短精确输入。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-underdetermined-0028",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 210,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[欠定不等于秩亏|Underdetermined systems]]\n\n$m<n$ can still have full row rank. Every target is then attainable, with $n-m$ free directions.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n欠定是形状，不等于秩低于 min(m,n)。最短解仍可唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-square-0003",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 495,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[方阵单侧逆|One-sided inverses of square matrices]]\n\nFor finite square matrices of the same size, either inverse identity implies the other and a unique inverse.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n同阶有限维方阵中，任一侧逆恒等式都推出另一侧，得到唯一双侧逆。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-group-canonical",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 1920,
      "height": 940,
      "label": "规范伪逆：定义 → SVD 公式 → 存在唯一性与投影几何"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-general-0006",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[广义逆|Generalized inverse]]\n\nHere $AGA=A$: return an input for every attainable output. Neither least squares nor minimum norm is automatic.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n本图采用单条件口径。可达输出能被恢复，但未必最小二乘，也未必最小范数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-mp-0004",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[Moore–Penrose 伪逆|Moore–Penrose pseudoinverse]]\n\nFour equations specify an inverse-like map: nearest attainable output, then shortest input.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n任意有限实复矩阵都有唯一伪逆；它不恢复已丢失的信息。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-svd-formula-0016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[伪逆SVD公式|Pseudoinverse from SVD]]\n\nReverse each positive singular stretch and swap input/output directions. Zero directions stay zero.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n紧 SVD 中仅正奇异值取倒数；零矩阵取反向尺寸的零矩阵。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-existence-0007",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 880,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[伪逆存在唯一性|Existence and uniqueness]]\n\nEvery finite real or complex matrix has exactly one pseudoinverse. SVD constructs it; all four equations remove ambiguity.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n包括零矩阵与长方矩阵。SVD 构造候选，四条件共同排除其余选择。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-project-col",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[AA+列空间投影|Output-space projection]]\n\n$AA^+$ projects onto $C(A)$ at every rank. The fitted output is unique.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n作用在输出空间；任意秩下，列空间中的最佳拟合唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-project-row",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[A+A行空间投影|Input-space projection]]\n\n$A^+A$ projects onto $C(A^*)=N(A)^\\perp$. It removes inputs invisible to $A$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n作用在输入空间，删去零空间分量；复数目标空间使用共轭转置 $A^*$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-minnorm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 310,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 240,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[最小范数最小二乘解|Minimum-norm least squares]]\n\nMinimize the residual first, then coefficient length among tied fits: $x_\\star=A^+b$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n先保最佳拟合，再去零空间分量；通常欧氏范数下唯一。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-group-numerical",
      "type": "group",
      "x": 2040,
      "y": 1110,
      "width": 1480,
      "height": 1280,
      "label": "数值反演：噪声边界 → 有效秩 → 截断或连续收缩"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-noise-0005",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2160,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[小奇异值放大噪声|Noise amplification]]\n\nKeep $A$ fixed. Each positive singular direction transfers observation error to coefficients with factor $1/\\sigma_i$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n固定 $A$，伪逆只反转正奇异值。放大取决于误差方向；这是绝对量。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-numrank-0009",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2540,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[数值秩|Numerical rank]]\n\nUnder an SVD cutoff, count $\\sigma_i>\\tau$. Report the scaling, tolerance and algorithm.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\nSVD 阈值口径严格保留大于阈值的值。CPQR 条件估计采用另一判据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-cpqr-boundary",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2920,
      "y": 1220,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CPQR秩揭示边界|CPQR rank evidence]]\n\nDiagonal magnitudes record successive residual lengths; these need not equal singular values. Strong RRQR adds quantitative bounds.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n普通 CPQR 的秩证据不自动具有强 RRQR 的最坏情况保证。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-ridge-0013",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2160,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[岭正则化|Ridge regularization]]\n\nMinimize $\\|Ax-b\\|^2+\\lambda\\|x\\|^2$, $\\lambda>0$. Penalizing all coordinates trades fit against coefficient size.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n全部坐标受罚保证唯一解；截距免罚时须单独说明，变量尺度也影响惩罚。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-ridge-filter-0017",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2160,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 380,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[岭的SVD滤波公式|Ridge inverse gains]]\n\nFor $\\|Ax-b\\|^2+\\lambda\\|x\\|^2$, $\\lambda>0$, every coordinate is penalized. Gain: $\\sigma_i/(\\sigma_i^2+\\lambda)$.\nRetained fraction: $\\sigma_i^2/(\\sigma_i^2+\\lambda)$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n全部坐标受罚时成立。相对精确反演的保留比例为 $\\sigma_i^2/(\\sigma_i^2+\\lambda)$。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-tsvd-0012",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2540,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 320,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[截断SVD反演|Truncated SVD inversion]]\n\nInvert only $\\sigma_i>\\tau$. The answer solves the retained-subspace problem and can discard signal.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n使用截断矩阵的伪逆；限制恢复方向可能损失信号，不普遍求解原始无限制问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-compare-0008",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2540,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[截断SVD与岭正则化|TSVD versus ridge]]\n\nTSVD removes selected positive directions; ridge shrinks every positive direction. If TSVD removes none, its operator is exactly $A^+$.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n硬截断与连续收缩施加不同恢复规则；不能只凭奇异值判定纯噪声方向。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-cpqr-backsolve-0029",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2920,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 270,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[CPQR回代不保最小范数|Basic versus shortest solution]]\n\nZero nonpivot coordinates select a basic solution; the shortest solution must be orthogonal to the null space.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n即使精确判秩，主元回代也未必给出最短系数。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-rankdef-algorithm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2920,
      "y": 1800,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[秩亏最小二乘算法|Rank-aware least-squares solve]]\n\nComplete orthogonal factorization or SVD removes the free null-space component after fitting.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n报告缩放、范数、容差与秩模型；阈值删除非零方向会改变问题。"
    },
    {
      "id": "pinv-footer",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 2470,
      "width": 3480,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "## 阅读路线\n\n判断单侧可逆性：定义 → 秩等价 → 满秩闭式，并分清欠定与秩亏。理解规范反解：一般广义逆 → Moore–Penrose 定义 → SVD 公式 → 存在唯一性与投影几何。做稳定反演：小奇异值放大 → 数值秩 → TSVD 或岭目标 → 岭滤波公式 → 明确算法保证。"
    },
    {
      "id": "p0049-idempotent",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 120,
      "y": 2130,
      "width": 1720,
      "height": 260,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "<!-- bilingual-en:start -->\n## [[幂等矩阵|Idempotent matrix]]\n\nAn idempotent map satisfies $P^2=P$: its first output is fixed by a second application. Hermitian symmetry makes it an orthogonal projector.\n<!-- bilingual-en:end -->\n\n幂等可能沿斜方向投影。Penrose 条件另外要求两个乘积为 Hermitian，才使保留与丢弃方向垂直。"
    }
  ],
